  "Frozen before replay (2026-10-25T04:33Z). Correctness fix, no parameter.",
  "Change: apps/native/rtk_base_epoch_align.hpp interpolateBaseEpoch evaluates the modeled base range at",
  "the target time (was: linear interpolation of the modeled range => raw linear interpolation of L/P).",
  "Repro: RtkBaseAlignmentTest.InterpolationReproducesObservationsGeneratedAtTargetTime (15 mm -> 4.5e-8 m).",
  "Reference: develop 66383b5 built from a clean worktree (same flags).",
  "Runs: Trimble Odaiba/Shinjuku (development), u-blox Odaiba/Shinjuku (holdout, 5 ms matching scorer),",
  "      HK Deep/Harsh (1 Hz rover = 1 Hz base, 0 interpolated epochs: must be byte-identical).",
  "Recipes: default; age5_doppler3; CD (hero opt-in) -- each fixed vs reference of the same recipe.",
  "Default-adoption gate (default recipe, every Tokyo run; same gate as docs/fix_recovery_guard.md):",
  " - wrong FIX >0.5/2/3 m must not increase",
  " - reference-correct FIX loss <= 1% (0.5 m)",
  " - missing epochs and horizontal P95 must not increase",
  " - recovery P95 and right-censoring (0.5 m) must not increase",
  " - HK POS byte-identical",
  "age5_doppler3 and CD: descriptive (same columns), not part of the gate.",
  "Mechanism (descriptive): lambda-shadow cost/pair p50 and max|z| p50 of accepted AR fixes, correct vs wrong,",
  "age5_doppler3 with --lambda-shadow-candidates (as docs/rtk_ambiguity_consistency_diagnostics.md).",
  "If any gate item fails: NO_GO for silent default change; report per-run deltas to the user, no retuning."
